WEBVTT

1
00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:04.616
Hey. Misionero.

2
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.816
- At last. eh?
- About time.

3
00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.520
Let's see what's there.

4
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:26.976
Totally pure.

5
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.360
C'mon...

6
00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:36.176
There was a fucking checkpoint
on every fucking corner!

7
00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.936
The Leyras are up our arse.
They want to control the free market.

8
00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:43.296
They want us to buy directly from them.

9
00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:46.336
Shit! Then what the fuck are we doing?

10
00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:50.576
This is my neighbourhood. arsehole.
I call the shots here.

11
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:54.920
You do as I say.
or I'm not paying you shit.

12
00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:58.080
So move. arsehole. Get to work.

13
00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.736
- All done?
- That's all of them.

14
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.160
Let's go.

15
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.936
Misionero. when are
you gonna lend me your sister?

16
00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.960
Already sick of giving blowjobs?

17
00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:05.696
Hi. Rosita.

18
00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:09.576
What if I asked you out
to a party after your shift?

19
00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.856
Stop bothering me. You better clear out.

20
00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:18.440
Okay. prick head!
Stop playing Romeo and get to work.

21
00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.760
Move it!

22
00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.456
All good. Linda?

23
00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.000
Come in. kid.

24
00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:41.256
Look at him!

25
00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.696
Look how skinny he is. a bag of bones.

26
00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:48.000
My mum says maybe I got a tapeworm.

27
00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:52.800
Take a sandwich.
We can't let this tapeworm starve.

28
00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.616
Watch out. that's a lot of money
for a kid like you.

29
00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.600
Whatever you need we're here.

30
00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.680
He's seen us.

31
00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.736
- What happened?
- We're in deep shit.

32
00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:01.040
A bunch of assholes with guns.

33
00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:06.040
One of them almost caught me.
but I got away.

34
00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:09.480
Open up. They're still lurking around.

35
00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.176
Come in.

36
00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.296
Motherfuckers!

37
00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:17.960
Lower your gun. arsehole.

38
00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:23.280
On the ground!

39
00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:26.120
Hands behind you!

40
00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:36.016
From now on anyone who wants to sell
has to do it through the Firm.

41
00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:40.016
They'll get a pay cheque
depending on the work they've done.

42
00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.216
Those who don't obey.

43
00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:45.160
will be executed.

44
00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:52.160
Come on!

45
00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:06.800
You're fucked. arsehole!

46
00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.840
Resign yourself.

47
00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:17.200
Accept your fucking destiny.

48
00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:42.960
This will happen to those
who don't cooperate with the Firm.

49
00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:49.240
To all those who dare to disobey.

50
00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:55.176
Go and tell everyone

51
00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.496
that we showed you mercy.

52
00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:01.376
We sacrificed one soul

53
00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:04.096
to save the rest.

54
00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.016
Tell everyone

55
00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:10.200
that we want peace and work for all.

56
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.240
Cut.

57
00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.880
Upload it to the web.

58
00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.640
I come to pay my respects.

59
00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.160
Come in.

60
00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:20.200
I brought this.

61
00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:24.960
We made a collection in the squadron.

62
00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:33.560
My "rabbit" wasn't perfect.

63
00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.560
He was only a kid.

64
00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:42.440
I don't even think
he was ready to be a father.

65
00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.936
But one thing's for sure.

66
00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:49.520
he wouldn't have double-crossed you.
not even with the drug squad.

67
00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.976
He was one of us.

68
00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.680
But now you need this.

69
00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.640
You know that he was good.

70
00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:08.120
My "rabbit" was good.

71
00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:12.176
Why are they saying
all that stuff about him?

72
00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:14.920
I don't know.

73
00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:19.840
- The Army says what it has to say.
- And you?

74
00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.576
He liked you.

75
00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.400
He respected you.

76
00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.416
Why do you betray him like this?

77
00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:33.336
Why do you let them
talk about him this way?

78
00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.600
I'm sorry.

79
00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.680
Wait.

80
00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.776
Don't go...

81
00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:49.200
please.

82
00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.320
Don't go.

83
00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.976
Thank you...

84
00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:21.720
for coming. for your help.

85
00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:27.400
I know you're good.

86
00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:32.200
I know it's not your fault.

87
00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.440
Thank you so much.

88
00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:44.136
Those beloved by God laugh!

89
00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:47.496
Those beloved by God cry!

90
00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:51.616
Those beloved by God are alive!

91
00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.136
Hallelujah. my brethren!

92
00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:57.096
Let us not waste this moment.

93
00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:01.456
Let us focus on ourselves.
on our psyche.

94
00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.416
Let us unite with God.

95
00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:06.776
Sit down
and do not miss this communion

96
00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.776
with Christ our Lord.

97
00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:12.456
He is intense. Real.

98
00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:15.520
He is the light.

99
00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:20.416
I invite you my brethren
to dedicate your lives.

100
00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:24.136
your souls. your bodies. your prayers.

101
00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:27.016
to Christ our Lord.

102
00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:31.056
We are the instruments of the Lord!

103
00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:34.400
Never forget that.

104
00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:31.120
- Can I help you. ma'am?
- Two bottles of cough syrup for adults.

105
00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:04.760
My friend! Keep an eye on my stuff.

106
00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:45.800
- Hey. man. how you doing?
- Cool.

107
00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:49.240
This guy wants medication.

108
00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:52.560
To stop spasms.

109
00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:59.600
Let's go.

110
00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.080
Baylo. sit here.

111
00:24:35.600 --> 00:24:39.000
Thank you for seeing us. Commissioner.

112
00:24:39.280 --> 00:24:42.216
Your ship was not authorized
to dock at this port.

113
00:24:42.240 --> 00:24:45.976
Correct. our merchandise is blocked
by Customs for inspection.

114
00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:48.736
But in our business
time is a decisive factor.

115
00:24:48.760 --> 00:24:51.216
We need to ship it immediately.

116
00:24:51.240 --> 00:24:54.160
And avoid a Customs inspection...

117
00:25:33.840 --> 00:25:36.600
Thank you. Commissioner.

118
00:32:30.280 --> 00:32:35.256
Problem? All our permits are
in order. that's why we're offloading.

119
00:32:35.280 --> 00:32:39.600
- I want to look inside the container.
- Do you have a warrant for that?

120
00:35:41.560 --> 00:35:44.000
Hey. brother.

121
00:36:48.680 --> 00:36:51.960
Yes! He's a giant!

122
00:37:17.760 --> 00:37:20.640
Put it all on him.

123
00:37:28.760 --> 00:37:30.800
Destroy him!

124
00:39:00.320 --> 00:39:02.856
- The container is in warehouse 15.
- Thanks.

125
00:39:02.880 --> 00:39:04.960
You're welcome.

126
00:39:24.680 --> 00:39:28.200
Hurry up. we don't have all night!

127
00:39:41.280 --> 00:39:44.280
Hurry up with the second truck!

128
00:40:20.600 --> 00:40:22.720
Hey! What the hell!

129
00:40:46.960 --> 00:40:49.160
Let's go!
